   "updated_at": "2026-11-02T06:23:37Z",
   "body": "Work in #398 (mac/lot-128): MP reply on a conversation, new MP composer (editable recipient and subject, draft per recipient), \"Nouveau message\" in the Messages list. Profile (LOT-116) and per-message \"MP\" (LOT-087) entries are not merged yet; they open this composer with `NewMessageTarget(link:)`.\n\nUXD-20 (#379) is still open: its recommendation would move the list entry and several recipients to M5 (split `128b` in docs/LOTS.md). The PR keeps the list button because legacy ObjC had it (`HFRMPViewController.m:511,537`, `TopicsTableViewController.m:222-245` @ 21173e77) and this issue's scope asks for it; several recipients are only HFR's own one-line `dest` field sent as typed (no separator rule). If the list button must wait for M5, it is one toolbar item in `MessageListView` to drop before merge. Decision needed (operator)\n",
